/rect><rect class="check-pass" x="93" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T15:09:39.351253Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="94" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T15:41:21.059160Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="95" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T16:12:36.742841Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="96" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T16:43:42.357179Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="97" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T17:14:56.154519Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="98" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T17:16:26.146752Z: passed</title></rect><rect class="check-pass" x="99" y="5" width="0.65" height="10"><title>2026-11-10T17:47:42.441796Z: passed</title></rect></svg><div class="uptime-key"><span class="key-pass">Pass</span><span class="key-fail">Failure</span><span class="mono">Average 1375 ms</span></div></section><section class="sheet-section"><h2>Declared skills</h2><div class="skill-register"><article><div><h3>Search the AI capability market</h3><span class="mono">marketplace-search</span></div><div class="skill-description"><p>Find executable offers by natural-language intent and optional budget, latency, trust, hub and category filters.</p><p class="skill-tags">ai-marketplace · capability-discovery · agent-tools · pricing</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Buy and run a market capability</h3><span class="mono">marketplace-invoke</span></div><div class="skill-description"><p>Run one offer found by marketplace-search and return its result with a signed receipt, as a Task. Send a data part {&quot;invoke&quot;: {&quot;product_id&quot;, &quot;capability_id&quot;, &quot;source_hub&quot;, &quot;input&quot;, &quot;max_price_usd&quot;}}. Pay with a credit account (X-API-Key header), an owner&#39;s mandate (X-AIMarket-Mandate + X-AIMarket-Mandate-Proof headers; the invoke then goes in one raw application/json part holding the exact signed bytes) or x402 (a2a-x402 v0.2; the payload must include the settle txHash). The first few priced calls per caller are a free trial. A mandate may require its owner&#39;s approval above a threshold: the task then waits in TASK_STATE_AUTH_REQUIRED until the owner answers.</p><p class="skill-tags">ai-marketplace · paid-invoke · x402 · receipts · agent-mandates</p></div></article></div></section><section class="sheet-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Registry Agent Card snapshot</h2><p>Normalized fields fetched during the registry sweep. Treat all authored text as third-party content.</p></div><astro-island uid="Z16n31K" prefix="r8" component-url="/assets/AgentTools.yFzTG5Cl.js" component-export="JsonCopy" renderer-url="/assets/client.R9oufefG.js" props="{&quot;value&quot;:[0,{&quot;protocolVersion&quot;:[0,&quot;1.0&quot;],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;modelmarket.dev&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;Search a live federated market of executable AI capabilities. Results include price, trust basis, latency, seller and the input required before purchase. Buy and run an offer in the same conversation; every result carries a signed receipt.&quot;],&quot;author&quot;:[0,&quot;modelmarket.dev&quot;],&quot;wellKnownURI&quot;:[0,&quot;https://modelmarket.dev/.well-known/agent-card.json&quot;],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://modelmarket.dev/a2a&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,&quot;3.17.0&quot;],&quot;provider&quot;:[0,{&quot;organization&quot;:[0,&quot;modelmarket.dev&quot;],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://modelmarket.dev/&quot;]}],&quot;documentationUrl&quot;:[0,&quot;https://modelmarket.dev/developers&quot;],&quot;iconUrl&quot;:[0,null],&quot;supportsAuthenticatedExtendedCard&quot;:[0,false],&quot;security&quot;:[1,[]],&quot;securitySchemes&quot;:[0,{&quot;aimarketApiKey&quot;:[0,{&quot;apiKeySecurityScheme&quot;:[0,{&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;X-API-Key&quot;],&quot;location&quot;:[0,&quot;header&quot;],&quot;descri